  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard vevent\" style=\"width:265px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"fn org summary\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height:1.2em; font-size:135%; font-weight:bold;\">United Tuareg Tribal Republic\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; border-top:solid 1px #aaa; padding:0.2em 0em 0.2em 0em;\">\n<table style=\"width:100%; text-align:center; margin:0 auto; background:transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; font-size:30%; line-height:105%;\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Mali (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTWFsaT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">←</span></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Flag of Mali\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b3/Flag_of_Mali.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20180511010906\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Mali.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Mali.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span><br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; font-size:115%; border:0;\"><b>2061–2125</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; text-align:right; line-height:105%; font-size:30%;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Tuareg Union Flag\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b6/Tuareg_Union_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20180517154117\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Tuareg Union Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Tuareg_Union_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tuareg Federation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHVhcmVnX0ZlZGVyYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">→</span></span><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"maptable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b6/Tuareg_Union_Flag.png/revision/latest?cb=20180517154117\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Tuareg Union\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b6/Tuareg_Union_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20180517154117\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"78\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Tuareg Union Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Tuareg_Union_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><br /> Flag\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\">Timbuktu\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Government</b>\n</td>\n<td>Confederated tribal constitutional republic\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Legislature</b>\n</td>\n<td>Congress\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Upper house\n</td>\n<td>Tribal Council\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Lower house\n</td>\n<td>General Assembly\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>History</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Independence from Mali Declared\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">1 September 2061\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Established\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2061\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">In Salah Constitutional Convention\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">November 19, 2125 2125\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Currency</b>\n</td>\n<td>Mediterranean Franc ($)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Today part of</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/African_Commonwealth\" title=\"African Commonwealth\">African Commonwealth</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>Tuareg Union</b> officially the <b>United Tuareg Tribal Republic,</b> abbreviated as the UTTR, was a nation-state in the Sahara region of Africa that existed from 2061 to 2125.\n</p><p>The Tuareg Union was formed during <a href=\"/wiki/The_Refreeze\" title=\"The Refreeze\">the Refreeze</a> when the Sahara terraforming project of the <a href=\"/wiki/Earth_Working_Group\" title=\"Earth Working Group\">Earth Working Group</a> neared completion. Several local leaders who'd cooperated with the EWG met in a tribal council where they declared that their people had a sovereign claim to this land when it was considered worthless and they would exercise that claim now that it was valuable.\n</p><p>The Tuareg Union formally ended in 2125 after the Treaty of Tripoli and was reconstituted into the Tuareg Federation, having lost its southern territory to separatist groups during the <a href=\"/wiki/Sahara_War\" title=\"Sahara War\">Sahara War</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205853\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 915/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9202/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1764/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/100\nExpensive parser function count: 16/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639940/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   81.627      1 Template:Infobox_former_country\n100.00%   81.627      1 -total\n 52.43%   42.796      2 Template:Ns0\n 47.14%   38.480      1 Template:Infobox_former_country/autocat\n 24.71%   20.171      2 Template:Str_find\n  3.43%    2.796      2 Template:Ordinal\n  2.50%    2.044      1 Template:Both\n  2.01%    1.642      3 Template:!!\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:2736-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205853 and revision id 7893. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
